:"勃海","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"95748169-db0e-11ef-b6f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河間國","place_name_jianti_auto":"河间国","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"9574816a-db0e-11ef-bdf3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"9574816b-db0e-11ef-bb18-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"琅邪","place_name_jianti_auto":"琅邪","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"9574816c-db0e-11ef-95c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"城陽國","place_name_jianti_auto":"城阳国","start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"9574816d-db0e-11ef-8f5c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"濟北、河間、城陽，皆漢舊國也。光武省濟北幷泰山，省河間幷信都，省城陽幷琅邪。今復泰山爲濟北國，在雒陽東千一百五十里；分樂成、涿郡、勃海爲河間國，在雒陽北二千五百里；分琅邪爲城陽國。濟，子禮翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"济北、河间、城阳，皆汉旧国也。光武省济北幷泰山，省河间幷信都，省城阳幷琅邪。今复泰山为济北国，在雒阳东千一百五十里；分乐成、涿郡、勃海为河间国，在雒阳北二千五百里；分琅邪为城阳国。济，子礼翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"95748158-db0e-11ef-8fb0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"淮陽頃王","people_name_jianti_auto":"淮阳顷王","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9574816f-db0e-11ef-9e83-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昞","people_name_jianti_auto":"昞","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"95748170-db0e-11ef-8d74-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"章和元年，淮陽頃王昞薨，未及立嗣，而國有大喪，今乃紹封。","note_content_jianti_auto":"章和元年，淮阳顷王昞薨，未及立嗣，而国有大丧，今乃绍封。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"9574816e-db0e-11ef-baf3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":70,"link_death_year":120,"link_td_description":"济北惠王刘寿，汉章帝第五子，母亲申贵人。","link_td_id":"Q10004563","link_td_number_id":1006183,"people_name":"壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"寿","people_xingming":"刘寿","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"95748171-db0e-11ef-96bc-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘肇