],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"3夏，五月，丙辰，封皇弟壽爲濟北王，開爲河間王，淑爲城陽王；紹封故淮南頃王子側爲常山王。","content_fanyi":"夏季，五月初七日丙辰，册封皇弟刘寿为济北王，刘开为河间王，刘淑为城阳王；封已故淮南顷王之子刘侧为常山王，承袭其父刘昞的爵位。","content_jianti_auto":"3夏，五月，丙辰，封皇弟寿为济北王，开为河间王，淑为城阳王；绍封故淮南顷王子侧为常山王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3789,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"95748157-db0e-11ef-967e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"派遣骑兵夺取伊吾","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_9574817ADB0E11EF8BE3A0D3651F611F_01"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"閻槃","people_name_jianti_auto":"阎槃","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"9574817c-db0e-11ef-a2e6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"章帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"章帝","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"95748183-db0e-11ef-8ca5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"稽落山","place_name_jianti_auto":"稽落山","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"9574817d-db0e-11ef-b39a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"伊吾","place_name_jianti_auto":"伊吾","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"95748184-db0e-11ef-92a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"北匈奴","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"95748185-db0e-11ef-af78-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"95748182-db0e-11ef-8640-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：乙十一行本正作「盤」。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：乙十一行本正作「盘」。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"95748181-db0e-11ef-8807-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"礱，盧紅翻。復，扶又翻。考異曰：西域傳作「閻槃」，今從帝紀。余謂副校尉閻槃，卽前戰于稽落山，恐當作「盤」。西域傳：章帝建初元年，罷伊吾屯田，北匈奴遣兵守其地，今復擊取之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"砻，卢红翻。复，扶又翻。考异曰：西域传作「阎槃」，今从帝纪。余谓副校尉阎槃，即前战于稽落山，恐当作「盘」。西域传：章帝建初元年，罢伊吾屯田，北匈奴遣兵守其地，今复击取之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"9574817b-db0e-11ef-bdd4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":92,"link_td_description":"窦宪，字伯度，祖籍扶风平陵（今陕西咸阳西北）人，窦融之曾孙，祖上六代居住于凉州。东汉外戚、权臣、将领。典故“燕然勒石”就来自窦宪，凉州武力豪族的代表人物之一。","link_td_id":"Q10000533","link_td_number_id":228047,"people_name":"竇憲","people_name_jianti_auto":"窦宪","people_xingming":"窦宪","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"95748188-db0e-11ef-8693-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"閻礱","people_name_jianti_auto":"阎砻","people_xingming":"阎砻","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"95748189-db0e-11ef-9caf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"前","people_name_jianti_auto":"前","people_xingming":"车师前王","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"9574818c-db0e-11ef-99bf-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[新疆吐魯番]"},{"people_name":"後王","people_name_jianti_auto":"后王","people_xingming":"车师后王","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"9574818d-db0e-11ef-94ea-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[新疆吉木萨尔县南]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9574817a-db0e-11ef-8be3-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"lóng","source_anchor_text":"副校尉閻礱將二千餘","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":8,"text":"礱","tongjian_id":"8c1d276d-c3a4-5792-8838-7eda493382dc"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9574817a-db0e-11ef-8be3-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"shè","source_anchor_text":"地車師震慴前後王各","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":33,"text":"慴","tongjian_id":"05467cd5-af0f-5681-b227-cadc038c5a7f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"北匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"北匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":943,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"9574818a-db0e-11ef-87cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"伊吾","place_name_jianti_auto":"伊吾","resolved_place_entity_id":1031,"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"9574818b-db0e-11ef-9ad4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"車師","place_name_jianti_auto":"车师","resolved_place_entity_id":759,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"9574818e-db0e-11ef-b1a6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"东汉与西域各国的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0614"},{"title":"东汉与匈奴的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0608"},{"title":"汉匈战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0568"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"四年，中郎将任尚屯伊吾。永初元年，复罢伊吾庐屯田吏士。元...","context_before":"...伊吾庐。是也。建初二年，罢伊吾庐屯兵。匈奴复遣兵守其地。","source_end_index":120,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"eca1e0a3-5547-5b13-875f-5b0e378ccd89","source_start_index":92,"source_text":"永元二年，窦宪遣副校尉阎砻击北匈奴之守伊吾者，复取其地。"},{"context_after":"元初末，北匈奴率车师后王击走前王，以其属于汉也。延光二年...","context_before":"...。建初元年，酒泉太守段彭等会兵柳中，击车师交河城，破之。","source_end_index":581,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2f876e71-3177-59d6-bc3a-0570328209f6","source_start_index":549,"source_text":"永元二年，窦宪遣兵复取伊吾庐地。车师震警，于是前后王各遣子入侍。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/四、夔州府（卷六十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"晋马隆用八阵以复凉州。陈泬持白虎幡，以武侯遗法教五营士。...","context_before":"...八阵赞》，又《握机文》之注。又汉时都肄已有孙吴六十四阵。","source_end_index":369,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"5d210eb9-88f5-5657-8ae2-762774abac0f","source_start_index":359,"source_text":"窦宪常勒八阵击匈奴。"}],"path":"四川方舆纪要/四、夔州府（卷六十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","外交"],"content":"4竇憲遣副校尉閻礱將二千餘騎掩擊北匈奴之守伊吾者，復取其地。車師震慴，前、後王各遣子入侍。","content_fanyi":"窦宪派副校尉阎砻率领两千多名骑兵袭击北匈奴驻守伊吾的军队，再次夺取该地。车师震惊，前王、后王各自派儿子入京侍奉天子。","content_jianti_auto":"4窦宪遣副校尉阎砻将二千余骑掩击北匈奴之守伊吾者，复取其地。车师震慴，前、后王各遣子入侍。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3790,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9574817a-db0e-11ef-8be3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Childre