1a5-db0e-11ef-8e12-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":32,"link_death_year":102,"link_td_description":"班超，字仲升，右扶风平陵县（今陕西省咸阳市秦都区）人，东汉将领、外交家。是开拓和维持汉代与西域关系的重要人物。","link_td_id":"Q10007410","link_td_number_id":13520,"people_name":"超","people_name_jianti_auto":"超","people_xingming":"班超","start_index":182,"tongjian_id":"957481a6-db0e-11ef-8e54-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9574818f-db0e-11ef-a750-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"jí","source_anchor_text":"謝果遣騎齎金銀珠玉","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":139,"text":"齎","tongjian_id":"478bea93-dde9-53d7-bcb0-a540cd2dc36b"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"月氏","place_name_jianti_auto":"月氏","resolved_place_entity_id":1803,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"95748197-db0e-11ef-969e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"月氏","place_name_jianti_auto":"月氏","resolved_place_entity_id":1803,"start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"9574819c-db0e-11ef-81c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"葱嶺","place_name_jianti_auto":"葱岭","resolved_place_entity_id":2180,"start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"9574819d-db0e-11ef-a872-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龜茲","place_name_jianti_auto":"龟兹","resolved_place_entity_id":649,"start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"957481a1-db0e-11ef-9286-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龜茲","place_name_jianti_auto":"龟兹","resolved_place_entity_id":649,"start_index":146,"tongjian_id":"957481a7-db0e-11ef-b5a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"月氏","place_name_jianti_auto":"月氏","resolved_place_entity_id":1803,"start_index":187,"tongjian_id":"957481a8-db0e-11ef-bb93-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"东汉与西域各国的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0614"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事","外交"],"content":"5月氏求尚公主，班超拒還其使，由是怨恨，遣其副王謝將兵七萬攻超。超衆少，皆大恐；超譬軍士曰：「月氏兵雖多，然數千里踰葱嶺來，非有運輸，何足憂邪！但當收穀堅守，彼飢窮自降，不過數十日決矣！」謝遂前攻超，不下，又鈔掠無所得。超度其糧將盡，必從龜茲求食，乃遣兵數百於東界要之。謝果遣騎齎金銀珠玉以賂龜茲，超伏兵遮擊，盡殺之，持其使首以示謝。謝大驚，卽遣使請罪，願得生歸，超縱遣之。月氏由是大震，歲奉貢獻。","content_fanyi":"月氏请求迎娶汉朝公主，班超拒绝并遣还其使者，月氏因此怨恨班超，便派副王谢率领七万兵马进攻班超。班超兵少，部众都非常恐惧；班超开导将士们说：“月氏兵虽然多，可是从几千里外翻越葱岭而来，没有运输补给，哪里值得忧虑呢！只要收好粮食，坚守城池，他们饥饿困窘，自会归降，不过几十天就能分出胜负了！”谢于是进兵攻打班超，攻不下来，抄掠也一无所得。班超估计月氏军队的粮草将要耗尽，必定会向龟兹求取粮食，于是派出数百名士兵到东部边界拦截他们。谢果然派骑兵带着金银珠玉前去贿赂龟兹，班超预先埋伏的士兵半路拦击，把他们全部杀死，并拿着使者的首级给谢看。谢大为惊恐，立即派使者向班超请罪，希望能活着回去，班超便把他们放走了。月氏因此大为震恐，每年向汉朝进贡。","content_jianti_auto":"5月氏求尚公主，班超拒还其使，由是怨恨，遣其副王谢将兵七万攻超。超众少，皆大恐；超譬军士曰：「月氏兵虽多，然数千里逾葱岭来，非有运输，何足忧邪！但当收谷坚守，彼饥穷自降，不过数十日决矣！」谢遂前攻超，不下，又钞掠无所得。超度其粮将尽，必从龟兹求食，乃遣兵数百于东界要之。谢果遣骑赍金银珠玉以赂龟兹，超伏兵遮击，尽杀之，持其使首以示谢。谢大惊，即遣使请罪，愿得生归，超纵遣之。月氏由是大震，岁奉贡献。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3791,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9574818f-db0e-11ef-a750-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"章帝","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"957481ab-db0e-11ef-89b3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"北海哀王","people_name_jianti_auto":"北海哀王","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"957481ac-db0e-11ef-b1b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"基","people_name_jianti_auto":"基","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"957481ad-db0e-11ef-96f4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"章帝元和三年，北海哀王基薨，無後。","note_content_jianti_auto":"章帝元和三年，北海哀王基薨，无后。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"957481aa-db0e-11ef-a53b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"無忌","people_name_jianti_auto":"无忌","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"957481af-db0e-11ef-8aa4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"齊王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐王","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"957481b0-db0e-11ef-a3a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晃","people_name_jian