ingming":"刘威","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"957481bf-db0e-11ef-974e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"北海王","people_name_jianti_auto":"北海王","people_xingming":"刘威","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"957481c0-db0e-11ef-ac25-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","resolved_place_entity_id":25,"start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"957481bc-db0e-11ef-896e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北海","place_name_jianti_auto":"北海","resolved_place_entity_id":595,"start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"957481bd-db0e-11ef-92cc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"6初，北海哀王無後，肅宗以齊武王首創大業而後嗣廢絕，心常愍之，遺詔令復齊、北海二國。丁卯，封蕪湖侯無忌爲齊王，北海敬王庶子威爲北海王。","content_fanyi":"当初，北海哀王没有后嗣。肃宗章帝因齐武王刘縯首创中兴大业，而后嗣却废绝，心中常为此哀怜，于是在遗诏中命令恢复齐、北海两国。五月十八日丁卯，封芜湖侯刘无忌为齐王，封北海敬王的庶子刘威为北海王。","content_jianti_auto":"6初，北海哀王无后，肃宗以齐武王首创大业而后嗣废绝，心常愍之，遗诏令复齐、北海二国。丁卯，封芜湖侯无忌为齐王，北海敬王庶子威为北海王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3792,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"957481a9-db0e-11ef-a50e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"諡法：一德不懈曰簡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谥法：一德不懈曰简。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"9576bd91-db0e-11ef-b48d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"竇太后","people_name_jianti_auto":"窦太后","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9576d15f-db0e-11ef-b631-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"沘陽公主","people_name_jianti_auto":"沘阳