,"excerpts":[{"context_after":"宋置狼山寨于山上。金末亦置寨于此]。","context_before":"...之子远遁斯山，因名。其东北为燕王仙台，相传燕昭王求仙处。","source_end_index":121,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b8b784ca-f0a1-54c2-b6b6-8093ea235850","source_start_index":90,"source_text":"其东为石虎冈，东汉中山简王焉之窆也。所遗石虎二，后人因以名冈。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/二、保定府（卷十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"7六月，辛卯，中山簡王焉薨。焉，東海恭王之母弟，而竇太后，恭王之甥也；故加賻錢一億，大爲脩冢塋，平夷吏民冢墓以千數，作者萬餘人，凡徵發搖動六州十八郡。","content_fanyi":"六月十二日辛卯，中山简王刘焉去世。刘焉是东海恭王的同母弟，而窦太后是东海恭王的外甥女；因此加赐助丧钱一亿，大修坟墓，铲平官民坟墓数以千计，征用役夫一万余人，总共因征发而扰动六州十八郡。","content_jianti_auto":"7六月，辛卯，中山简王焉薨。焉，东海恭王之母弟，而窦太后，恭王之甥也；故加赙钱一亿，大为修冢茔，平夷吏民冢墓以千数，作者万余人，凡征发摇动六州十八郡。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3793,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9576bd90-db0e-11ef-9276-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"是否接受冠军侯封爵","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_9576D16BDB0E11EFBA97A0D3651F611F_01"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"冠軍縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"冠军县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9576d16d-db0e-11ef-9e91-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"南阳郡","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9576d16e-db0e-11ef-965e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"郾縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"郾县","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"9576d16f-db0e-11ef-8520-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潁川郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍川郡","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"9576d170-db0e-11ef-a8d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"夏陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"夏阳县","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"9576d171-db0e-11ef-95f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"馮翊郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"冯翊郡","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"9576d172-db0e-11ef-b624-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[